{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19656","headline":"同恭夏日题寻真观李宽中秀才书院 · 吕温","name":"同恭夏日题寻真观李宽中秀才书院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闭院开轩笑语阑，江山并入一壶宽。\n微风但觉杉香满，烈日方知竹气寒。\n披卷最宜生白室，吟诗好就步虚坛。\n愿君此地攻文字，如炼仙家九转丹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19656.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19656","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}